{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:58:05+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:58:05+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Villeroy & Boch AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"Germany","city":"Mettlach","website":"https://www.villeroyboch-group.com","employees":11016,"summary":"Villeroy & Boch AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of ceramic products under the Villeroy & Boch brand in Germany. It operates through two divisions, Bathroom & Wellness, and Dining & Lifestyle. The company offers ceramic bathroom collections, ceramic kitchen sinks, fittings, bathroom furniture, showers, bathtubs, pipe connectors, installation systems, and matching accessories; and porcelain, glass and cutlery, as well as home accessories and gifts. It also provides tiles, lighting, carpets for indoor and outdoor use; bathroom and kitchen textiles; and blankets and cushions. The company sells its products through point of sales and digital channels, as well as retailers, tradespeople, architects, and project developers. Villeroy & Boch AG was founded in 1748 and is headquartered in Mettlach, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Villeroy & Boch AG, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des produits céramiques sous la marque Villeroy & Boch en Allemagne. Il opère à travers deux divisions, salle de bain et bien-être, et salle à manger et style de vie. La société propose des collections de salles de bains en céramique, des éviers de cuisine en céramique, des accessoires, des meubles de salle de bains, des douches, des baignoires, des raccords de tuyaux, des systèmes d'installation et des accessoires correspondants; et de la porcelaine, du verre et des couverts, ainsi que des accessoires et des cadeaux pour la maison."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":306554528,"share